...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

crew: "미팅 준비 Crew" { class: ours }
strategist: 전략 수립 에이전트 { class: ours }
claude: "Claude API" { class: ext }

crew -> strategist: strategy_development_task 실행 지시(context: task1·2)
strategist -> claude: 지시문 + task1·2 출력
claude -> strategist: 전략·의제 markdown
strategist -> crew: task3 출력 반환
